  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_archer1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Students from the Archery Section need not to depend solely on strength. Consider upgrading your character's agility to increase the accuracy of hitting your targets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_archer1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_archer1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu mendapat hadiah 3 Stat Point setiap kali karakter kamu naik level. Kekuatan karaktermu tergantung dari Stat Point yang kamu distribusikan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">If you concentrate on Dexterity, you will develop great Attack Speed and become a Fast Attack Type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Distri</VALUE>
