  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_knight1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Please remember that the evil can't control everyone!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">There aren't too many normal human beings around anymore. Most have already been transformed into evil monsters. Although it's a really bad situation, it's not like things can't be changed for the b</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
