  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">The last thing I heard was something about the No. 4 Wharf. I think you can just ignore it. Maybe.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">You might not have any help, but it won't be hard to search for it.</VALUE>
