  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">I can see that you've gotten stronger and will need a new weapon soon. Once you reach Lv. 30, 50 and 70, come Kembali to me to exchange your weapon. Also, you know that it is not possible to exchange while you are equipping it, right?</VALUE>
